'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 8''' was the eighth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 19, 2026 at the Ogasawara Municipal Gymnasium in [[Ogasawara]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 4 matches.

The night is remembered for the Kuroshio reunion match — [[KAZUKI (wrestler)|KAZUKI]] against [[Daigo Kuroki]], the man who broke the stable open — and for the Dragon's first blood: [[Tadayoshi Ishida]] submitting [[Takagi Yuto]] with the Ishida Lock, while KAZUKI and [[Taumafa Vaiahi|Taumafa]] stayed perfect atop the block.

